'''Gourd trees''' are [[tree]]s found in the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. When picked, they yield [[empty gourd vial]]s, which are used on the nearby geyser to [[Water-filled gourd vial|fill them with water]], which are then used to brew [[Chambers of Xeric/Potions|potions]].

